<view class="detail-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state"><view class="state-copy">正在准备这一杯…</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state"><view class="state-title serif">稍等一下。</view><view class="state-copy">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="backToMenu">返回菜单</button></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{product}}"><view class="photo"><image class="product-photo" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="photo-note">A LITTLE SWEETNESS.</text></view><view class="pad detail-body"><view class="title-line"><view class="serif product-title">{{product.name}}</view><text class="price money">¥{{price}}</text></view><view class="english">{{product.english_name}}</view><view wx:if="{{product.is_out_of_stock && !product.reservation_only}}" class="stock-notice">暂时缺货，恢复供应后可下单；当前不接受预约。</view><view wx:if="{{product.reservation_only}}" class="reservation-notice"><text class="reservation-tag">{{product.is_out_of_stock ? '缺货 · 可预约' : '预约商品'}}</text><view>需至少提前 {{product.reservation_lead_minutes}} 分钟预约。加入购物袋后，在确认订单选择取餐时间，最晚可约未来 24 小时。</view></view><view class="description">{{product.description}}</view><view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="group" class="group"><view class="group-title">{{group.title}}</view><view class="options"><button wx:for="{{group.choices}}" wx:key="label" class="option {{selected[group.key] === item.label ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-group="{{group.key}}" data-label="{{item.label}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}<text class="numeric">{{item.extra_label}}</text></button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!groups.length}}" class="note-box">每日现做，让咖啡与小食一起慢慢享用。</view></view><view class="fixed-footer detail-footer"><view class="stepper"><button class="quantity-symbol quantity-minus" data-delta="-1" bindtap="changeQty" aria-label="减少数量"></button><text class="quantity-number">{{quantity}}</text><button class="quantity-symbol" data-delta="1" bindtap="changeQty" aria-label="增加数量"></button></view><button class="primary" disabled="{{!isOpen || !orderable}}" bindtap="add">{{!isOpen ? '门店暂未接单' : !orderable ? '商品暂时缺货' : '加入购物袋'}}<view class="quantity-symbol add-symbol"></view></button></view></block>
</view>
